<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

    <title>Delivery Information | STREETKICKS</title>

    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/responsive.css">
</head>

<body>

<header class="site-header">
    <div class="container header-inner">

        <a href="/" class="logo">STREETKICKS</a>

        <nav class="main-nav">
            <a href="/">Home</a>
            <a href="/shop">Shop</a>
            <a href="/shop?category=new">New Arrivals</a>
            <a href="/shop?category=collections">Collections</a>
            <a href="/shop?category=deals">Deals</a>
        </nav>

        <div class="header-actions">
            <a href="/shop">⌕</a>
            <a href="/wishlist">♡</a>
            <a href="/cart">🛒</a>

            <button id="theme-toggle" type="button">☾</button>

            <button class="menu-toggle" type="button">☰</button>
        </div>

    </div>
</header>

<main>

<section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
        <span class="hero-label">STREETKICKS</span>
        <h1>DELIVERY</h1>
        <p>Everything you need to know about delivery.</p>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="content-section">

<div class="container">

    <div class="content-block">

        <h2>Delivery Information</h2>

        <p>
            We aim to make getting your STREETKICKS order as simple
            and convenient as possible.
        </p>

    </div>

    <div class="info-grid">

        <div class="info-card">
            <h3>Order Processing</h3>
            <p>
                Orders are normally processed after payment and
                confirmation of the order.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="info-card">
            <h3>Delivery Areas</h3>
            <p>
                Delivery availability depends on the location
                provided during checkout.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="info-card">
            <h3>Delivery Time</h3>
            <p>
                Delivery time may vary depending on your location
                and courier availability.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="info-card">
            <h3>Tracking</h3>
            <p>
                Where tracking is available, customers can use
                the provided tracking information to follow their order.
            </p>
        </div>

    </div>

    <div class="content-block">

        <h2>Important Information</h2>

        <ul>
            <li>Please provide an accurate delivery address.</li>
            <li>Ensure your phone number is reachable.</li>
            <li>Delivery times may change because of unforeseen circumstances.</li>
            <li>Contact customer support if your order is delayed.</li>
        </ul>

    </div>

</div>

</section>

</main>

<footer class="site-footer">
    <div class="container">
        <p>&copy; 2026 STREETKICKS. All rights reserved.</p>
    </div>
</footer>

